<item>
 <title>OGC 3D Tiles support in X3DOM</title>
 <link>https://www.web3d.org/news-story/ogc-3d-tiles-support-x3dom</link>
 <description>&lt;div class=&quot;field field-name-field-summary field-type-text-long field-label-hidden&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field-items&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field-item even&quot;&gt;The Web3D Consortium is advancing a major interoperability milestone with the introduction of OGC 3D Tiles support in X3DOM, enabled through a Cesium Ecosystem Grant. This development unites the strengths of X3D, glTF, and 3D Tiles to deliver high‑performance streaming of large‑scale geospatial content—such as terrain, photogrammetry, and buildings—directly into declarative X3D scenes. &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field field-name-field-dated-press-release field-type-list-boolean field-label-inline clearfix&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field-label&quot;&gt;Press Release:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field-items&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field-item even&quot;&gt;No&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field field-name-field-release-date field-type-datetime field-label-inline clearfix&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field-label&quot;&gt;Release Date:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field-items&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field-item even&quot;&gt;&lt;span  property=&quot;dc:date&quot; datatype=&quot;xsd:dateTime&quot; content=&quot;2026-07-25T00:00:00-07:00&quot; class=&quot;date-display-single&quot;&gt;Sat, 2026-07-25&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
